  "notes": "{治療|ちりょう} refers to the medical process of treating illness, injury, or disease. It covers a wide range from simple treatments to long-term therapy.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {治療|ちりょう}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to treat, to cure\n- {治療|ちりょう}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{受|う}ける→受ける：01215_ukeru⟧: to receive treatment\n- {治療|ちりょう}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{続|つづ}ける→続ける：01231_tsuzukeru⟧: to continue treatment\n- {治療|ちりょう}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{専念|せんねん}する→専念する：25369_sennensuru⟧: to focus on treatment\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- {治療|ちりょう}⟦{法|ほう}→法：13620_hou⟧: treatment method, therapy\n- ⟦{治療費|ちりょうひ}→治療費：26893_chiryouhi⟧: medical expenses\n- {治療|ちりょう}⟦{中|ちゅう}→中：09840_chuu⟧: under treatment\n- ⟦{歯科|しか}→歯科：11072_shika⟧{治療|ちりょう}: dental treatment\n- ⟦{放射線|ほうしゃせん}→放射線：14998_houshasen⟧{治療|ちりょう}: radiation therapy\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{診察|しんさつ}→診察：03259_shinsatsu⟧: medical examination (diagnosis stage)\n- ⟦{手術|しゅじゅつ}→手術：03218_shujutsu⟧: surgery (a specific type of treatment)\n- ⟦{療養|りょうよう}→療養：08207_ryouyou⟧: convalescence, recuperation (recovery stage)",
